{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38637","headline":"闻雁 · 卢汝弼","name":"闻雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风萧瑟静埃氛，边雁迎风响咽羣。\n瀚海应嫌霜下早，湘川偏爱草初薰。\n芦洲宿处依沙岸，榆塞飞时度晚云。\n何处最添羁客恨，竹窗残月酒醒闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢汝弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}